ocs that disagree with code. Never read or print holdout prompt text (split holdout in command-prompts.jsonl, or holdout-prompts.jsonl): counts only. The reviewer changes no code and writes only inside its lineage folder.\",\n44:   \"reviewScopeFiles\": [\n45:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\",\n46:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/agents-md.md\",\n47:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/agents-md-manifest.json\",\n48:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml\",\n49:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt\",\n50:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install.yaml\",\n51:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml\",\n52:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup-presentation.txt\",\n53:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\",\n54:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml\",\n55:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt\",\n56:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-symlink-check.yaml\",\n57:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown\",\n58:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs\",\n59:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs\",\n60:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs\",\n61:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs\",\n62:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-check.test.cjs\",\n63:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs\",\n64:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/codex-hook-approval-check.test.cjs\",\n65:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs\",\n66:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs\",\n67:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs\",\n68:     \".skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\",\n69:     