{"type":"text","timestamp":1794570272212,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","part":{"id":"prt_1d4b936a5002jInUa2T5nLyXek","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","messageID":"msg_1d4b9260e001cQCTI4OoWg8bgH","type":"text","text":"BINDING: target=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\nBINDING: maxIterations=7\nBINDING: convergence=0.1\nBINDING: mode=review\nBINDING: dimensions=correctness,security,traceability,maintainability\nBINDING: specFolder=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\n\nInitializing the detached lineage now, then I will review the doctor-install area.","time":{"start":1794570270373,"end":1794570272212}}}
