{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570847545,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c201a6001QICWR3ouUSS3X3","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","messageID":"msg_1d4c1f23f001KiMet7Q04mEUvl","type":"tool","id":"call_77fa32a3e490404b810c769a","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"function startsCommand\\|function runsMarker\\|previous === '-c'\\|isNodeExecutable\\|tokens\\[index + 1\\]\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs; grep -n \"Exit 3 means\\|SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG\\|When the resolved URL\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md"},"output":"129:function isNodeExecutable(token) {\n133:function startsCommand(tokens, index) {\n137:  return previous === '-c'\n144:function runsMarker(command, marker) {\n146:  return tokens.some((token, index) => isNodeExecutable(token)\n148:    && (tokens[index + 1] || '').endsWith(marker));\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:104:      - \"Exit 3 means a write failed after the backup. When the output holds restored:, the engine put every recorded path back: quote the ERROR line, show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and say the tree is as the plan found it. When it holds nothing was restored, the tree is as the failed write left it: show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and name the undo command as the next step.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md:82:When the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"129:function isNodeExecutable(token) {\n133:function startsCommand(tokens, index) {\n137:  return previous === '-c'\n144:function runsMarker(command, marker) {\n146:  return tokens.some((token, index) => isNodeExecutable(token)\n148:    && (tokens[index + 1] || '').endsWith(marker));\n.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml:104:      - \"Exit 3 means a write failed after the backup. When the output holds restored:, the engine put every recorded path back: quote the ERROR line, show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and say the tree is as the plan found it. When it holds nothing was restored, the tree is as the failed write left it: show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and name the undo command as the next step.\"\n.skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md:82:When the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"function startsCommand\\\\|function runsMarker\\\\|previous === '-c'\\\\|isNodeExecutable\\\\|tokens\\\\[index + 1\\\\]\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs; grep -n \\\"Exit 3 means\\\\|SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG\\\\|When the resolved URL\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570846630,"end":1794570847545}}}}
