{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571215686,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c7a03b001mSU8GaC1rTjWy7","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","messageID":"msg_1d4c78f820017HA8oPMvkBDBLj","type":"tool","id":"call_ef9f4c4ba7934e4c9ca48fc0","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"An embed that exits 3\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt; grep -n \"the restore failed\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs; grep -n \"a restore that throws\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs"},"output":"256:A check that exits 2 prints its message and ends `STATUS=ERROR ERROR=\"[message]\"`. An embed that exits 1 after its proof found a dropped line restored from the backup by itself, so its `Changed:` is `none` and its `Next:` names the file whose line went missing. An embed that exits 3 had a write fail after its backup. Its Changed: is none when the output holds restored:, and otherwise the reply says the tree is partly written and its Next: is the undo command the engine printed.\n1434:      output.warn(`${TAG} ERROR: the restore failed: ${restoreError.message}`);\n744:test('a restore that throws is reported with the backup and undo lines and exits 3', (t) => {\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"256:A check that exits 2 prints its message and ends `STATUS=ERROR ERROR=\"[message]\"`. An embed that exits 1 after its proof found a dropped line restored from the backup by itself, so its `Changed:` is `none` and its `Next:` names the file whose line went missing. An embed that exits 3 had a write fail after its backup. Its Changed: is none when the output holds restored:, and otherwise the reply says the tree is partly written and its Next: is the undo command the engine printed.\n1434:      output.warn(`${TAG} ERROR: the restore failed: ${restoreError.message}`);\n744:test('a restore that throws is reported with the backup and undo lines and exits 3', (t) => {\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -n \\\"An embed that exits 3\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt; grep -n \\\"the restore failed\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs; grep -n \\\"a restore that throws\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571214907,"end":1794571215686}}}}
