{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571451967,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4cb35780012vR1QVNDs8fFxh","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","messageID":"msg_1d4cb1ffb001g2kCEJE2HbKRCv","type":"tool","id":"call_6b517fe80f9c4b999cf5bca3","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- A symlink at an absent-only path still passes -- ruled out: `expectsAbsent` is read before the symlink verdict (iteration 2, evidence: `agents-md-check.cjs:713-719`).\n- A marker mentioned only in a description still counts as wired -- ruled out: `collectCommands` reads `command` entries, and the description-only test reports `hook-missing` (iteration 3, evidence: `hook-wiring-check.cjs:114-122`).\n- An absent Codex entry still routes to a command that only reads -- ruled out: the check prints the copy-and-approve repair and the setup text routes to it (iteration 3, evidence: `codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:171-183`).\n- The symlink-check output block still omits the hook-wiring exits -- ruled out: WARN, FAIL and the worse-status rule are present (iteration 3, evidence: `doctor-symlink-check.yaml:69-72`).","oldString":"- A symlink at an absent-only path still passes -- ruled out: `expectsAbsent` is read before the symlink verdict (iteration 2, evidence: `agents-md-check.cjs:713-719`).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2/deep-review-strategy.md\n====