{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571854659,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4d15854002LaYQnIYyDvhdJ7","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a18a6ffeJYEGLs0dTSiOZ0","messageID":"msg_1d4d1400b001wBXF1CpeTYDyJu","type":"tool","id":"call_eb0ce2cda8584ed186375e22","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && LINEAGE=\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2\" && sed -n '104p' .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml; sed -n '133,148p' .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs | head -3; sed -n '82p' .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md; sed -n '651p' .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs; sed -n '536p' .skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml | cut -c1-160"},"output":"      - \"Exit 3 means a write failed after the backup. When the output holds restored:, the engine put every recorded path back: quote the ERROR line, show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and say the tree is as the plan found it. When it holds nothing was restored, the tree is as the failed write left it: show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and name the undo command as the next step.\"\nfunction startsCommand(tokens, index) {\n  if (index === 0) return true;\n  const previous = tokens[index - 1];\nWhen the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on.\n  const expected = entries.length - failed.length - unmeasured.length - pointerMissing.length;\n    gate3_location: \"AGENTS.md (created when absent, replaced with the shipped sections plus the composed block), CLAUDE.md and .codex/AGENTS.md (folded into th\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"      - \"Exit 3 means a write failed after the backup. When the output holds restored:, the engine put every recorded path back: quote the ERROR line, show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and say the tree is as the plan found it. When it holds nothing was restored, the tree is as the failed write left it: show the backup and undo lines, end with STATUS=FAIL and name the undo command as the next step.\"\nfunction startsCommand(tokens, index) {\n  if (index === 0) return true;\n  const previous = tokens[index - 1];\nWhen the daemon holds no hook health records, the leg prints hook health not recorded and names `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`, the setting that turns the records on.\n  const expected = entries.length - failed.length - unmeasured.length - pointerMissing.length;\n    gate3_location: \"AGENTS.md (created when absent, replaced with the shipped sections plus the composed block), CLAUDE.md and .codex/AGENTS.md (folded into th\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && LINEAGE=\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2\\\" && sed -n '104p' .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-embed.yaml; sed -n '133,148p' .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs | head -3; sed -n '82p' .skilled/commands/doctor/setup.md; sed -n '651p' .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs; sed -n '536p' .skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml | cut -c1-160\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571851860,"end":1794571854659}}}}
